# TESS Hauling & Cleanouts

> junk removal serving chandler, AZ.

## Business

**Trade**: junk removal
**Location**: chandler, AZ

## Services

- **Full Junk Removal**: We haul away unwanted items of all sizes from anywhere on your property — garages, backyards, or curbside. No job is too big or too small.
- **Home Cleanouts**: Clear out entire rooms, estates, or properties quickly and efficiently. Our junk removal team handles sorting, loading, and disposal so you don't have to.
- **Office & Commercial Cleanouts**: Relocating or downsizing your Chandler business? We remove old furniture, equipment, and debris with minimal disruption to your operations.
- **Furniture & Appliance Pickup**: Bulky sofas, mattresses, refrigerators — we safely remove and responsibly dispose of large items that curbside pickup won't take.
- **Construction Debris Removal**: Post-renovation messes are no problem. We clear drywall, lumber scraps, tile, and other construction waste from your job site fast.
- **Eco-Friendly Disposal**: We sort loads for donation and recycling wherever possible, keeping usable items out of Chandler-area landfills and giving them a second life.

## About

TESS Hauling & Cleanouts LLC was built on a simple promise: show up on time, work hard, and leave your space cleaner than we found it. We proudly serve Chandler and the surrounding East Valley with honest, upfront pricing and a no-hassle experience from first call to final sweep. Whether you're clearing a single room or an entire property, our team treats your home or business with the same care and respect we'd want for our own.

